apply.\n\n- **I.** The range of the function is $(-\\infty ,-1].$\n- **II.** $y=-1$ is the maximum value of the function.\n- **III.** $x=15\\pi $ is in the domain." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty ,-1]\\cup [1,\\infty ),$ therefore the function doesn't have a maximum value. Hence, statements I and II are both false.\n\n- The function's domain is all real numbers except the integer multiples of $\\pi $, such as $0,\\pm \\pi ,\\pm 2\\pi ,….$ Hence, statement III is false."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517000 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92d6129b-a5c5-597a-86ee-3f19af20f326" :knowledge-point/title "Describing the General Properties of the Cosecant Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e6bab16-c48f-5d71-ba04-cf367cce07b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516997} {:answer/id #uuid "667b9553-a43f-59bc-b1b6-5bed93f5c4ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517035}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "667b9553-a43f-59bc-b1b6-5bed93f5c4ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517035} :answer-field/id #uuid "48a1b1d0-374d-5bcf-bbe7-a158735199f1" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517021} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d10d23ea-ef11-567f-9135-741e36bcc11b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517074} {:answer/id #uuid "dd3c1360-6a0f-5970-9c1c-5f22dee27b5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517080}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d10d23ea-e